{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1300189-prime-4-in-technocracy","id":1300189,"title":"Prime 4 in technocracy","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-03-26T21:28:41-07:00","id":1300189,"title":"Prime 4 in technocracy","content":"Hi all.<br /> <br /> I'm currently in a technocracy game, and bought into prime 4. There's a lot to be done with prime, but making it not vulgar af is an issue I'm having. Specifically stuff like:<br /> <br /> Destroying a pattern with an energy weapon.(2)<br /> <br /> &quot;Absorbing&quot; an inanimate object or sphere effect for quintessence.(4)<br /> <br /> Any way I look at it, material objects just ceasing to exist is going to be vulgar. Any ideas are much appreciated.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24282-neveq","name":"Neveq","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-27T06:08:12-07:00","id":1300256,"title":"","content":"Prime isn't the most Coincidental Sphere out there. That being said:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> &quot;Absorbing&quot; an inanimate object or sphere effect for quintessence.(4) </div> </div> </div>Well, if it ceases to exist from nowhere it's Vulgar, but people would expect introducing the item in a nuclear furnace or something like that would make it &quot;cease to exist&quot;. As long as the item disappears in a conventional way it's Coincidental. That's why you use a big and cumbersome &quot;matter/energy converter&quot; that uses a lot of power and heat to disolve the object, rather than just zapping it away.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Destroying a pattern with an energy weapon.(2) </div> </div> </div>Yeah, personal energy blasters are going to be Vulgar. I doubt the Consensus it's quite there yet. Better to charge regular bullets with Prime 2 so they cause aggravated.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1683-aleph","name":"Aleph","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3056"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-27T08:48:41-07:00","id":1300295,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aleph</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1300189-prime-4-in-technocracy?p=1300256#post1300256\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Prime isn't the most Coincidental Sphere out there. That being said:<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Well, if it ceases to exist from nowhere it's Vulgar, but people would expect introducing the item in a nuclear furnace or something like that would make it &quot;cease to exist&quot;. As long as the item disappears in a conventional way it's Coincidental. That's why you use a big and cumbersome &quot;matter/energy converter&quot; that uses a lot of power and heat to disolve the object, rather than just zapping it away.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Yeah, personal energy blasters are going to be Vulgar. I doubt the Consensus it's quite there yet. Better to charge regular bullets with Prime 2 so they cause aggravated.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Yeah the &quot;matter/energy converter&quot; sounds like what it'll have to be; not quite an on-the-go device.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24282-neveq","name":"Neveq","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}